OL,3,ASix Ukrainian energy sites hit by
OL,4,ARussia since Trump announced ceasefire,
OL,5,AZelensky says
OL,6,
OL,7,FThere were blackouts in the city of
OL,8,FIzyum after a Russian strike destroyed
OL,9,Fpower grids, Ukraine's state news
OL,10,Fagency Ukrinform said, while energy and
OL,11,Frailway infrastructure in western
OL,12,FUkraine was also targeted overnight.
OL,14,FOn Monday, Russia's Foreign Minister
OL,15,FSergei Lavrov said Ukraine does not
OL,16,Fdeserve the "respite" a ceasefire would
OL,17,Fbring.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
